      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "In 2019 only \"_EMISSION\" and \"EDITOR_VISUALIZATION\" seem to be the only global builtin keywords and because of the nature of \"EDITOR_VISUALIZATION\" that leaves only \"_EMISSION\"\nhttps://gist.github.com/Float3/b221f51a7aec7bf5a54fed7a17197ae2\nPostProcessing Keywords all still use \"#pragma multi_compile\" which declares a set of global keywords (unless suffixed with \"_local\" e.g. \"#pragma multi_compile_local\")",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
